      source_ref: feat/recursive-improvement-promotion-gate
    note: promotion with NO candidate evaluation evidence is refused (fail-closed default is no)
  - command: npm test
    path: test/bandit.test.ts
    scope: project
    provenance:
      author: pi-agent
      created_at: "2026-09-10T22:04:40.994Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: feat/recursive-improvement-promotion-gate
    note: a regressing generation is refused by the gate and the refusal reason is recorded as lineage; a single lucky held-out sample cannot promote below the gate minimum sample count; the gate refusal is attributable
